=== the three measured systems, 60 crossing targets, 8 seeds each ===
    budget axis = oracle-CPU-seconds; metric = panel-unanimous, independently adjudicated
    (see the USD section at the end: seconds are only the right currency while no LLM is in
     the loop, which is true of every operator here today and will not stay true)

